Each white chicken produces 5 eggs per day, so total eggs from white chickens: \( 5(w) = 5(r + 2) \).

Total eggs collected per day: \( 3r + 5(r + 2) = 42 \).

Simplify the equation:
\[ 3r + 5r + 10 = 42 \]
\[ 8r + 10 = 42 \]
\[ 8r = 32 \]
\[ r = 4 \]

Thus, Jerry has \(\boxed{4}\) red chickens.
