\[ x + 2x + 3x = 180^\circ \]
\[ 6x = 180^\circ \]
\[ x = \frac{180^\circ}{6} = 30^\circ \]

The largest angle is three times the smallest angle:
\[ 3x = 3 \times 30^\circ = 90^\circ \]

So the measure of the largest angle is \(\boxed{90}\) degrees.
